BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Moab Museum": "https://moabmuseum.org/events/2026-annual-museum-gala/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:moab_museum
SUMMARY:2026 Annual Museum Gala
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260326T000000
DTEND;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260326T000000
UID:683f59fe86f867292d942eb9c05cd56d@moabmuseum.org
DESCRIPTION:You are invited to an evening of spirited celebration in suppo
 rt of the Moab Museum. Costumes and creative attire are warmly encouraged!
  Bring a copy of your ticket (printed or on your phone) and prepare for a 
 night where Moab’s early days come alive. This year’s Gala channels th
 e spirit of Robbers Roost\, boomtown saloons\, and Prohibition-era intrigu
 e—reimagined with style\, wit\, and a touch of mischief. Guests will enj
 oy: A lively cocktail hour in a transformed saloon-inspired setting Immers
 ive moments with outlaws\, sheriffs\, card games\, and surprise encounters
  A plated dinner with curated beverage options The only live auction in to
 wn\, featuring exceptional regional experiences\, artwork\, and one-of-a-k
 ind adventures Awards honoring community partners\, volunteers\, and Museu
 m collaborators A vintage-style photo booth to capture the night’s best 
 looks and worst alibis This is the Moab Museum’s signature fundraiser—
 supporting exhibitions\, education programs\, and the preservation of the 
 stories that made this place what it is today. Early Bird (through Februar
 y 18): Members: $75 General Admission: $100 After February 18: Members: $9
 0 General Admission: $115 Seating is limited. Early ticket purchase is str
 ongly encouraged.
LOCATION:Hoodoo Hotel\, Curio Collection by Hilton\, 111 N 100 W\, Moab\, 
 UT 84532
URL:https://moabmuseum.org/events/2026-annual-museum-gala/
X-SOURCE:Moab Museum
END:VEVENT
